--- !u!102 &979028230897308215
TextMesh:
  serializedVersion: 3
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 979028230897308216}
  m_Text: 'Demo2 shows how to grip parts wiht Grip Script.

    - Kinematic is defined
    totally separate from CAD with Groups and Kinematic scripts

    - Part is exchanged
    between two grippers

    - Gripping is started automatically when "PartToGrip"
    Sensor is high

    - Sensors are using Raycasts

    - Cylcle is controlled
    and synced with Signals and Drive_Sequence '
